Hello!

I have made a massuve uptime of 4 days by now, altough i didn't run rtorren=
t. yesterday (early today) i noticed that the garbage collector might have =
not honoured the 3 day protection interval, but i'm not sure... if it will =
be repeated, I'll send you lots of logs.

So, tried to start rtorrent now, dut it instantly quit, and the console was=
 flooded with nice traces and stuff... I attach a slabinfo and a kern.log. =
They are big, so i bzip them.

... one other idea. i save this letter now, and sent it after a restart, wi=
th some status report then...

rtorrent escapes during the hash check... so it is a filesystem corruption =
or similiar. too bad there is no fsck yet. well, I make a snapshot, and del=
ete the affected files, and see if the problem arises even after that.

